{"id":"1da4ab3df97a0b08","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-applicative-trs.md","title":"应用式重写系统","display":"df-applicative-trs — 应用式重写系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-applicative-trs","aliases":["56-df-applicative-trs"],"display":"df-applicative-trs — 应用式重写系统","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.3.5, printed p73","source_ocr_block":"94","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-applicative-trs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-applicative-trs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-applicative-trs — 应用式重写系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.3.5, printed p73"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"94"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ap}\\in F\">\\(\\mathsf{Ap}\\in F\\)</span> 为指定符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,u_i\\in T\">\\(u,v,u_i\\in T\\)</span>。第一式在任意上述指定符号上定义系统谓词；第二式的应用记法仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2\\)</span> 时定义，连续应用的零参数情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0\">\\(u_0\\)</span>，其余情形由下式递归给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ApplicativeTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\mathsf{Ap})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2\\land\\forall f\\in F\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\;(\\mathrm{ar}(f)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ApplicativeTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\mathsf{Ap})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2\\land\\forall f\\in F\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\;(\\mathrm{ar}(f)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"uv\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u,v)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2),\\qquad u_0u_1\\cdots u_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u_0\\cdots u_{n-1},u_n)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[uv\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u,v)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2),\\qquad u_0u_1\\cdots u_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u_0\\cdots u_{n-1},u_n)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.3.5（印刷 p73，OCR 页块94）。应用是一阶二元构造子，不带函数类型约束，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uu\">\\(uu\\)</span> 合法。它与“应用序/最左最内策略”的 applicative-order 含义不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ap}\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,u_i\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2","display":false},{"tex":"u_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ApplicativeTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R,\\mathsf{Ap})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2\\land\\forall f\\in F\\setminus\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\;(\\mathrm{ar}(f)=0).","display":true},{"tex":"uv\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u,v)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2),\\qquad u_0u_1\\cdots u_n\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ap}(u_0\\cdots u_{n-1},u_n)\\quad(\\mathrm{ar}(\\mathsf{Ap})=2,\\ n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}).","display":true},{"tex":"uu","display":false}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取四个两两不同的函数符号 $S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}$ 和可数无限变量集 $V$，假定 $V\\cap\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\}=\\varnothing$。其中 $S,K,I$ 的元数为0，$\\mathsf{Ap}$ 的元数为2。采用 [[56-df-applicative-trs]] 的左结合应用记法。$x,y,z\\in V$ 两两不同，$t$ 为集合参数；规则中的变量可按替换任意实例化。"},{"id":"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-applicative-trs.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}